+class S2PEmb(nn.Module):
+    """pose-s2p (= ppm/pose-s2p/code/model_ppm.S2PEmb): the pose tower's NEW input term at T = sum over the speech codebooks used of a per-code
+    row (= a linear map of the one-hot speech codes of the SAME position T, i.e. channel B's Mimi codes of the very frame whose pose cb0 is
+    predicted at T). Weight ZERO at init (the table IS the term's output projection): the tower input is bit-identical to today's at step 0
+    and every used row gets a non-zero gradient from step 0. 'full' = all 32 codebooks (32 x 2048 rows, global ids = code + 2048 c), 'cb0' =
+    cb0 only (2048 rows). -1 = no speech codes at T (segment frames before CD, SLOT / GAP frames) -> 0 (H2.code_feedback)."""
